  "description": "Xbox WebView2 host bridge for the Vizbee Continuity SDK.\n\n      Exposes Xbox system information (device id, advertising id, network info,\n      launch params, and app lifecycle events) to the Vizbee JavaScript SDK\n      running inside a Microsoft.Web.WebView2 control. Required because WebView2\n      on Xbox does not expose WinRT globals to JavaScript.\n\n      Usage:\n        await WebView2.EnsureCoreWebView2Async();\n        await Vizbee.Xbox.WebView2Bridge.AttachAsync(WebView2);",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.png",
